From: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] tests: synchronize multipart upload retry counters

The multipart test server handles parts concurrently. Protect its retry map so
Go does not abort on concurrent map reads and writes on slower architectures.
This changes only the test harness, preserving all upload assertions.

Signed-off-by: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
--- a/object_test.go
+++ b/object_test.go
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 	"os"
 	"reflect"
 	"strconv"
+	"sync"
 	"testing"
 	"time"
 )
@@ -384,18 +385,23 @@
